  "description": "The Retrotec Funduro is a versatile full-spectrum trail bike, balancing capability with distinctive style. Every frame is hand built by Curtis Inglis in Napa, California, and features modern geometry, components, and tubing.\nProduction frames are made to order, not in stock. Each frame is built by hand using standardized sizing and options to keep the process simple and accessible. Typical lead time is 12-14 weeks from deposit. For the most current estimates, see the FAQ.\nProduction frames are ordered with a non-refundable deposit, which secures your place in the build queue and is applied toward the total frame price. After checkout, Curtis will reach out within 48 hours to confirm order details, and specify all remaining options.\nEvery Retrotec frame is built by hand in Napa, California, with a focus on local production, direct collaboration, and hands-on craftsmanship.",
